      "text": "\\[ \\begin{aligned} (2^2 - 2) - &(3^2 - 3) + (4^2 - 4) \\\\ &= 2 - 6 + 12 \\\\ &= 8. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nThus, D is the correct answer.",
